  "worked_solution": "We use the central difference approximation\n\n$$\n{f}^{\u2032}(x)\u2248\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x-h)}{2h}\n$$\n\n \nat the point $x=5$ with the step size $h=0.1.$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{\u2032}(x) & \u2248\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x-h)}{2h} \\\\ {f}^{\u2032}(5) & \u2248\\frac{f(5+0.1)-f(5-0.1)}{2(0.1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{f(5.1)-f(4.9)}{0.2} \\\\  & =\\frac{2.36-3.12}{0.2} \\\\  & =\\frac{(-0.76)}{0.2} \\\\  & =-3.8.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
